The horror elements focus on atmosphere, sound design, and suspense, making every corner feel unpredictable. Whether playing solo or with others, Chimpan VR aims to deliver a unique blend of mobility, exploration, and psychological horror in a Gorilla Tag\u2013inspired format.", "short_description": "Chimpan VR is a Gorilla Tag\u2013inspired horror fangame set in a mysterious research facility, featuring multiple levels, tense atmosphere, and fast-paced VR locomotion as players explore, escape, and uncover what went wrong inside the lab."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1N0BYtXy4Ij4PCIdSD0XtlSyhcTBOuSklixkr6uxWnuM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SplashyGTVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpanvrgame/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26979315061658187"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823286_1212196071092669_2165311096591528282_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=btdf1L8zDCYQ7kNvwEPfJJ0&_nc_oc=Adpd0AuTDFFcclRW-69DfkcXED0A3N3oVocdlqWjMkTTdFmkbVXt3pdod2Pp_YrJq2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9PKiK-2lRY3VI7Sy32wdjGlBe