series of eerie levels, each with its own environments, mechanics, and threats.\n\nPlayers move using Gorilla Tag\u2013inspired arm-based locomotion, climbing walls, leaping across corridors, and navigating ventilation shafts while avoiding unknown dangers lurking in the shadows. The facility map features dimly lit hallways, experimental chambers, maintenance tunnels, and high-security sectors, creating a sense of tension and mystery as players progress deeper into the complex.\n\nEach level introduces new challenges, such as environmental hazards, puzzles, or hostile entities, encouraging exploration and skillful movement. The horror elements focus on atmosphere, sound design, and suspense, making every corner feel unpredictable. Whether playing solo or with others, Chimpan VR aims to deliver a unique blend of mobility, exploration, and psychological horror in a Gorilla Tag\u2013inspired format.", "short_description": "Chimpan VR is a Gorilla Tag\u2013inspired horror fangame set in a mysterious research facility, featuring multiple levels, tense atmosphere, and fast-paced VR locomotion as players explore, escape, and uncover what went wrong inside the lab."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1N0BYtXy4Ij4PCIdSD0XtlSyhcTBOuSklixkr6uxWnuM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SplashyGTVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpanvrgame/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua